{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">原油期貨價格輕微上升。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">紐約期油收市報91.48美元一桶，升18美仙，升幅百分之0.2。倫敦期油收市報96.28美元一桶，升76美仙，升幅近百分之0.8。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">全個星期計，紐約期油升百分之9。倫敦期油升近百分之8。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T22:58:16.542582+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}